	GamePrint "[color=yellow]--- ZORK I Help ---[/color]"
	GamePrint "Move: [b]north[/b] (n), [b]south[/b] (s), [b]east[/b] (e), [b]west[/b] (w), [b]up[/b] (u), [b]down[/b] (d)"
	GamePrint "Also: [b]ne[/b], [b]nw[/b], [b]se[/b], [b]sw[/b], [b]in[/b], [b]out[/b]"
	GamePrint ""
	GamePrint "Actions: [b]look[/b] (l), [b]inventory[/b] (i), [b]take[/b], [b]drop[/b], [b]open[/b], [b]close[/b]"
	GamePrint "[b]examine[/b] (x), [b]read[/b], [b]eat[/b], [b]drink[/b], [b]attack[/b] [target] [b]with[/b] [weapon]"
	GamePrint "[b]put[/b] [item] [b]in[/b] [container], [b]turn on[/b]/[b]off[/b], [b]unlock[/b] [item] [b]with[/b] key"
	GamePrint "[b]wave[/b], [b]dig[/b], [b]tie[/b], [b]pray[/b], [b]say[/b], [b]inflate[/b], [b]climb[/b], [b]ring[/b]"
	GamePrint ""
	GamePrint "Meta: [b]score[/b], [b]diagnose[/b], [b]verbose[/b], [b]brief[/b], [b]tts[/b], [b]wait[/b] (z), [b]help[/b], [b]quit[/b]"
End Sub

